                </span>

                <h2>
                    Environmental
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Care for parks, waterways, wildlife, and other
                    natural resources in your community.
                </p>

            </article>

            <article class="category-card">

                <span class="category-number">
                    02
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Educational
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Support students and lifelong learning through
                    tutoring, mentoring, and educational programs.
                </p>

            </article>

            <article class="category-card">

                <span class="category-number">
                    03
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Community Service
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Strengthen neighborhoods through projects that
                    meet local needs and bring people together.
                </p>

            </article>

            <article class="category-card">

                <span class="category-number">
                    04
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Health and Wellness
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Support physical, mental, and community wellness
                    through helpful programs and outreach.
                </p>

            </article>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>